Z||000000||Madrox86GT||10-11-2000||11:00 PM||||i once had a wall that housed 4 12's...knocked hard as hell...but sold it and now just want plans for 2 10's, so if you know anyone who knows how to build a box for a fiero...let me know.<P>------------------<BR>You know my saying is:<P>"life is  a  B I T C H... then you marry one."<P>-Red 84 SE for parts(or 300 all together)-<BR>-Trade/Sell 86 GT-<BR>-New Pioneer Raido and 4X10's-<P>-Silver V6 SE(wrecked) $300<BR>-Black 85 coupe(parts car)$500<BR>-or both black and sliver for $750||||reg||1
